    <string name="eco_msg_excellent">"🌱 Excellent choice! Using cloth diapers saves approximately %1$s kg CO₂e. Each cloth diaper can be reused hundreds of times, while disposable diapers take more than 500 years to decompose. Your eco-friendly washing with %2$d cloth diapers (%3$d efficient washes) is making a real difference!\n\n  📅 If you maintain this habit, you can reduce the carbon footprint by:\n• In 30 days: %4$s kg CO₂e\n• In 1 year: %5$s kg CO₂e\n  👉 %6$s\n"</string>
    <string name="eco_msg_progress">"🌿 Great progress! Your %1$d cloth diapers help reduce carbon emissions. Consider using more cloth diapers to increase your environmental impact. With efficient washing (%2$d loads), you are already saving the planet!\n\n  📅 If you maintain this habit, you can reduce the carbon footprint by:\n• In 30 days: %3$s kg CO₂e\n• In 1 year: %4$s kg CO₂e\n  👉 %5$s\n"</string>
    <string name="eco_msg_consider">"💚 Consider switching to cloth diapers! They can significantly reduce your carbon footprint. Just 8 cloth diapers with an eco-friendly wash cycle can replace many disposable diapers and help protect our environment for future generations.\n\n  📅 If you maintain this habit, you can reduce the carbon footprint by:\n• In 30 days: %1$s kg CO₂e\n• In 1 year: %2$s kg CO₂e\n  👉 %3$s\n"</string>

    <string name="co2_analogy_low">Equivalent to turning off unnecessary lights and appliances for several weeks 💡</string>
    <string name="co2_analogy_mid_low">Equivalent to a car running without moving for 10 to 40 hours 🚗</string>
    <string name="co2_analogy_mid">Equivalent to driving a car for 1 to 2 months 🚘</string>
    <string name="co2_analogy_mid_high">Equivalent to a short international flight ✈️</string>
    <string name="co2_analogy_high">Equivalent to one or two international flights or one year of car use 🚗✈️</string>
    <string name="co2_analogy_very_high">Equivalent to the full annual carbon footprint of an average person 🌍</string>

